Root causes:
- Full stack traces contained no `Caused by:` entries.
- `JdkHttpClientBuilder` read `java.home`, which is unset by default in Native Image, causing the initial `NullPointerException`.
- After resolving that, tracing exposed missing reflection metadata for `com.azure.core.implementation.ImplUtils`.

